{"chapter_count":3,"chapters":[{"date":"2024-12-27","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":-1,"kind":"chapter","layout":{"image_parallax":false,"mobile_padding":24,"padding":48,"placements":[]},"position":0,"quote":"","reveal":{},"story":"The chalet stands against the light, its wood dark against the snow. We unload and leave the bags in the hallway. Late in the afternoon the light turns red, and the peaks behind the house flare up briefly before the cold sets in.","title":"Arriving in snow"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":-2,"kind":"pair","layout":{"columns":2,"gap":24,"image_parallax":false,"media_width":"cover-frame","mobile_columns":1,"mobile_gap":20,"mobile_padding":24,"padding":48,"parent_id":-1,"placements":[{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-1-1","photo_id":-2},{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-1-7","photo_id":-8}],"ratio":"original","show_title":false},"position":1,"quote":"","reveal":{},"story":"","title":"In backlight"},{"date":"2024-12-29","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":-3,"kind":"chapter","layout":{"image_parallax":false,"mobile_padding":24,"padding":48,"placements":[]},"position":2,"quote":"","reveal":{},"story":"On the lake the haze is so dense that the mountains stand behind it only as shadows. A rusty jetty reaches a little way out and simply stops. Further up, beside a stream, someone has stacked stones into a small tower. We walk past and turn around once more.","title":"Water that gives nothing away"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":-4,"kind":"pair","layout":{"columns":2,"gap":24,"image_parallax":false,"media_width":"cover-frame","mobile_columns":1,"mobile_gap":20,"mobile_padding":24,"padding":48,"parent_id":-3,"placements":[{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-3-2","photo_id":-3},{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-3-3","photo_id":-4}],"ratio":"original","show_title":false},"position":3,"quote":"","reveal":{},"story":"","title":"By the water"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":-5,"kind":"quote","layout":{"image_parallax":false,"mobile_padding":24,"padding":48,"placements":[],"show_title":false,"text_preset":"medium"},"position":4,"quote":"In snow every sound grows smaller. Only the light stays loud.","reveal":{},"story":"","title":"Field note"},{"date":"2025-01-01","gallery_mode":"horizontal","id":-6,"kind":"chapter","layout":{"image_parallax":false,"mobile_padding":24,"padding":48,"placements":[{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-5-5","photo_id":-6},{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-5-6","photo_id":-7},{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-5-4","photo_id":-5}]},"position":5,"quote":"","reveal":{},"story":"On New Year's Day we climb. The suspension bridge spans two snowy summits, and we cross it slowly, without talking. At the top the whole range opens up, ridge behind ridge, until it disappears into white.","title":"The first light of the year"},{"date":"","gallery_mode":"editorial","id":-7,"kind":"image","layout":{"image_parallax":false,"media_width":"cover-frame","mobile_padding":24,"padding":48,"placements":[{"edits":{"show_title":true},"id":"showcase-6-0","photo_id":-1}],"show_title":false},"position":6,"quote":"","reveal":{},"story":"","title":"Alpine panorama"}],"closing":"On the last evening we walk to the canal once more. The path leads towards the mountains and ends nowhere. Tomorrow we drive back; the panorama comes with us.","country":"Switzerland","cover":{"alt":"Wide view over snow-covered Alpine peaks","chapter_id":null,"credit":"","demo":true,"description":"","featured":false,"height":1467,"id":-1,"large_url":"/WANDER/images/ch-panorama-2200.webp","original_url":null,"position":0,"source_url":"","srcset":"/WANDER/images/ch-panorama-640.webp 640w, /WANDER/images/ch-panorama-1280.webp 1280w, /WANDER/images/ch-panorama-2200.webp 2200w","title":"Alpine panorama","url":"/WANDER/images/ch-panorama-1280.webp","width":2200},"cover_focus":null,"cover_id":-1,"demo":true,"description":"From the chalet in backlight to t